      "dialogue_id": "sp_ashwatthama_cornered",
      "speaker_id": "ashwatthama",
      "dialogue_text": "You killed my father by deceit! Now I have killed your sons! If you want my life, you will have to pay with everything! Into this blade of grass, I invoke the Brahmashira! For the destruction of the Pandavas!",
